# Quest for Ancient Secrets with Innocent Blood: "Each player sacrifices a creature of their choice." Bot2 must choose
# between two creatures, so the spell pauses mid-resolution. Bot1's only creature, Llanowar Elves, is sacrificed into
# Bot1's graveyard (one Quest trigger), and then Innocent Blood itself finishes resolving into it (CR 608.2n, a second
# trigger). Bot2's sacrificed creature feeds Bot2's graveyard and not Bot1's Quest: two quest counters in all.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Quest for Ancient Secrets
Llanowar Elves
Innocent Blood
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Mox Emerald
Llanowar Elves
Guerrilla Gorilla
Forest x20


[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Quest for Ancient Secrets.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald#1.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald#2.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Guerrilla Gorilla.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Innocent Blood.Cast
Bot2.Choose(Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Accept
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Innocent Blood; Llanowar Elves
Bot2.Graveyard = Llanowar Elves
Bot1.Battlefield.Quest for Ancient Secrets.Counters.Quest = 2
